		{
			dependencies: ["6CAF000000000001"]
			description: [
				"&eFree Runners&r cancel fall damage and step up blocks; the &eScuba set&r breathes for you underwater. Cheap quality-of-life that saves your life weekly."
				""
				"&e&lFree Runners are the single best early Mekanism item.&r They go in your feet slot, run on stored energy, and give you:"
				"&7- &fNo fall damage&7 while charged"
				"&7- &fAuto step-up&7 a full block - no more jumping around your own base"
				""
				"&7Toggle the step-assist and the fall protection separately with the mode key while holding them. Turn step-up off when doing precision building.&r"
				""
				"&e&lThe Scuba set&r is a mask plus a tank. It matters more than it sounds in this pack - the Undergarden and several Blue Skies areas will drown you, and Venus is worse."
				""
				"&c&lBoth need charging.&r An Energy Cube or any charger will do it. Free Runners that run flat stop protecting you from falls, which is exactly the moment you find out they were flat."
				""
				"&8These are the cheap precursor to the MekaSuit. Do not skip them waiting for the good version - the good version is hundreds of hours away."
			]
			icon: "mekanism:free_runners"
			id: "6CAF000000000002"
			rewards: [{
