		{
			dependencies: ["398BE9895D2BED1B"]
			description: [
				"The &eAtomic Disassembler&r is every tool in one handle - pickaxe, axe, shovel, sword - with adjustable speed and a power cell where durability used to be."
				""
				"The Meka-Tool will replace it eventually. Until then, this IS the endgame tool."
			]
